/*
  TeslaAccountSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0216 · TeslaAccountSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `TeslaAccountSection`
  resolves (table "TeslaAccountSection") lives here with its web English value. These entries fold
  into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared
  catalog. In tests / preview bundles (where the table is absent) `NSLocalizedString` returns the
  `value:` fallback, keeping the projection deterministic.

  The first group is the parity set extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/settings/components/TeslaAccountSection.tsx); the i18next `{{days}}` / `{{count}}`
  interpolation tokens are rendered as the platform-native `%@` positional argument. The second group
  backs the native chrome (the P4 leaf freshness / loading / error / toast copy) so the Swift sources
  hold no English prose literals.
*/

